      "mergedPostDetails": "It seems I encountered a bug where I would get all the buttons when my instance queue was ready. These included VRC Wallet, Accept, Decline, Reply, View Profile, and More...\n\nThis was actually kinda funny to me. For shiggles, I clicked VRC Wallet, which brought me to the VRC Credits page. When I backed out of the menu and reopened my notifications, all of the buttons disappeared. I was able to clear the notification by clicking the Decline All button at the top of the menu.\n\nThe world I was trying to join was The Great Pug.",
